== About the numbers

- Numbers marked *working value* are invented orders of magnitude chosen to keep arithmetic honest.
- Real figures from a published source carry the year and a citation.

== Licence, contributing, printing

- *Licence.* Text and figures: CC BY-SA 4.0. Build scripts and templates: MIT.
- *Original content only.* Public sources may be _cited_ and their _facts_ used in your own words; record each in `SOURCES.md`.
- *Printing.* A4 or Letter, 100% scale, duplex, black and white. *We recommend spiral (coil) binding*, so the book lies flat while you write. Margins are equal (20mm) on every page, so the holes fit on the left whichever way you bind.
